<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<Library LVVersion="21008000">
	<Property Name="NI.Lib.Description" Type="Str">Version 1.0.0.3 - First Build
Version 1.1.0.0 - UI updates
Version 1.2.0.0 - Updated Logic to only housekeep at 200mS rate.  Read timeout combines houskeep timer and configured rate. 
Version 1.3.0.0 - Update to stats and benchmarks
Version 1.3.1.0 - Bug fix for clock adjustment that would be skipped due to not all packets read error.
Version 1.3.2.0 - Fixed bug on time pair publishing
Version 1.4.0.0 - Added support for Linux Desktop and Windows
Version 1.4.1.0 - Windows fix for Timed Loop priority and mute of 9006 warning.  
Version 1.4.2.0 - Windows Log timestamp update to use wall clock time
Version 1.4.3.0 - Standard support for mute late cycle warnings on Linux and Windows.  Mute gRCP client timeout in UI.
Version 1.4.4.0 - Flexible tag linking support added.
Version 2.0.0.0 - Update to gRPC core library.
Version 2.0.1.0 - Support for Core UI Class update
Version 2.0.2.0 - Register gRPC Descriptors set as config option
Version 3.0.0.0 - Support for Core Class to Events
Version 3.0.1.0 - Include updated CIPC with bug fix for backpressure and Core update with bug fix to handle error from cleanup.
Version 3.0.2.0 - Incorporate core update to close plugin on disconnect of CIF manager
Version 3.0.3.0 - Memory Optimization</Property>
